<title>POLAND: GERMAN FIRM BUYS 35,000 FARM FOOD SHARES.</title>
<headline>GERMAN FIRM BUYS 35,000 FARM FOOD SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Conrad Jacobson GmbH on Tuesday bought 35,000 shares in the Polish food producer Farm Food SA, raising its holding to 884,500 shares, or 30.91 percent of votes, Farm Food said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday 35,000 Farm Food shares traded on the kerb of the Warsaw bourse at 38.5 zlotys per share against 33.7 zlotys at the regular bourse session and 35.5 zlotys at Wednesday's bourse session.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
